kimi-alab
Copyright 2026 Andrew Yates

kimi-alab is a harness: it runs Moonshot AI's Kimi Code CLI (`kimi`, MIT licensed,
https://github.com/MoonshotAI/kimi-code) as an unmodified child process. It does not contain,
ship, fork or patch any Kimi Code bytes; the `kimi` it runs is the build the atpkg package
manager installed from the vendor's own distribution. "Kimi" and "Kimi Code" are Moonshot AI's
names, used here only to say which program the harness runs.

The resume grammar and session-lock layout this harness relies on were read from Kimi Code
2.3.1's published source (tag @moonshot-ai/kimi-code@2.3.1) and are cited file by file in
src/kimi.rs and README.md; no Kimi Code source is copied into this repository.
